  "notes": "Single image with front and back views; headers taken from the upper view, JST ports from the lower view (both views show USB at top). S1.2 printed for both MOSI and MISO, copied as printed. SDO read as letter O (FS0 beside it shows a dotted zero). Joystick, buttons, SD card, display, speaker enable, light sensor (A7), voltage divider, accelerometer interrupt and NeoPixel entries have no physical wiring position and were skipped; battery and unlabeled speaker connectors skipped."
